ersatz ed (eed) - learning project of writing an ed-like editor in c++

not intended to be made into a fullscreen editor like vim, emacs,
notepad, etc, instead meant to run more similarly to a command
interpreter for text editing, e.g (in the shell/command line):

> eed textfile.txt # run eed, open file "textfile.txt"
> 23 # prints line 23
  this is the contents of line 23
>

please write all code by hand, this is a learning project, you can
still ask ai questions just don't copy and paste

should be it for now, happy hacking!